{#
  The verify Job's identity, rendered into `tdarr-verify` beside `job.yaml.j2`.

  It is a ServiceAccount with no Role. The Job reads no API and execs into no pod, so it needs
  no grant, and its pod mounts no token. tdarr's VAAPI encode through its own ffmpeg is the
  one check that would need `pods/exec`; the Deployment's `vaapi-encode` initContainer runs it
  instead (#5451).
#}
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: ServiceAccount
metadata:
  name: tdarr-verify
  namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
automountServiceAccountToken: false
